Time Series Forecasting

GDP forecasts are generated for future quarters.

Statistical Forecasting Models
ARIMA
Captures trend and autoregressive behavior.

SARIMA
Captures quarterly seasonality.

Holt-Winters Exponential Smoothing
Captures trend and seasonal effects.

Prophet
Flexible forecasting with trend decomposition.

